# Breezy Does It (levels/solo/breezy.txt): one idea, wind carrying Nat. The dip's fan floats him
# up a step, a fan at the next step's foot; a hanging vent box blows him over a dry ditch, the
# next over sewage (toot to land); the bubble bath (run on, the posts' updrafts hold him up;
# toot for the bank's nugget); a vent too high to jump to (hop onto the fan under it, jump and
# toot into its gust); the headwind pit (jump, toot as he clears the gust). Five toots by the
# valley, the last at the top of the fan that stops short: Down (Giant Steps). The fan floats
# him up the cliff, the canyon's sunken fans carry him over it, the awning's gust down the
# slope, the bubble bath again tosses him high along the nuggets; the band winds down over the
# hill, and the last vent box, the two fans and the fan pit take him to the plunger in the
# everyday wind.
